# The CRISPRoff energy tables are a protocol-0 pickle. With core.autocrlf=true
# (the Windows default) git rewrites its LF bytes to CRLF on checkout, which
# corrupts it: `pickle.load` then fails with
# "the STRING opcode argument must be quoted". Force binary handling.
*.pkl binary
*.np binary
*.npy binary
*.bw binary
*.fa binary
*.gz binary
